            <div xml:id="d705">

                <pb facs="0811" n="726" xml:id="pg726"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.00/265: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >McMillin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-10T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 10, 1919,
                                5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received July 11,
                            7.11 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your July 8th, 6 p.m. 1 and 2. Leguia planning elections extent of which not yet
                    known. Has promised last three days would publish decree thereon. Promises press
                    to publish tomorrow.</p>
                <p>3. No tangible evidence now in possession of the Legation and none so far
                    obtainable. Having military attaché discreetly investigate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McMillin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
